{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"y":0.073340166783997685,"x":0.82298275044146996,"c":1,"t":"Test 2","w":0.062681115468343096,"h":0.017563852431769611},{"w":0.70300750732421879,"t":"тUToR: On the other hand, you could talk about the numerous ways that nanotechnology is","y":0.12354651148322759,"h":0.01747087440564421,"c":1,"x":0.073308276743766401},{"w":0.1127819569905599,"t":"being applied.","h":0.013218040245237983,"c":1,"x":0.13533834471387929,"y":0.1423052154996991},{"c":1,"x":0.12969924745324846,"y":0.15697674391227667,"t":"You mean things like thin films on camera displays to make them water-repellent,","w":0.62969924926757814,"h":0.015988372635703296},{"y":0.17289117826291955,"x":0.13533834365831979,"c":1,"t":"and additives to make motorcycle helmets stronger and lighter.","w":0.48496241251627603,"h":0.016097875080489321},{"x":0.12964131190318171,"y":0.18756040562775445,"t":"Exactly. Or another way would be to focus on its impact in one particular area, say","w":0.63920639038085936,"h":0.018945518341359158,"c":1},{"t":"medicine, or space exploration.","x":0.13721804339442722,"y":0.20637475861101939,"h":0.013200257566001294,"c":1,"w":0.24248120625813802},{"x":0.13533835475768272,"w":0.46804509480794265,"c":1,"h":0.01457700035453835,"t":"That would make it easier to focus. Perhaps I should do that.","y":0.22238372112722504},{"h":0.008862984234182969,"x":0.073286330337139161,"c":1,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.24120804274738683,"w":0.047036361694335935},{"c":1,"x":0.075187969999646373,"y":0.25726744177197558,"h":0.0087209303610875644,"w":0.037593984603881844,"t":"RUSS:"},{"y":0.27325581384357722,"h":0.011627907148116901,"w":0.048872181574503584,"c":1,"x":0.071428570772898589,"t":"TUTOR:"},{"x":0.12969925404127769,"w":0.26315788269042967,"h":0.01481004507405026,"c":1,"t":"I think that would be a good idea.","y":0.23824855094208996},{"t":"Right. How important is it to include slides in the presentation?","c":1,"y":0.25287183595569362,"w":0.48320256551106772,"h":0.017224871260230978,"x":0.13341313351357437},{"w":0.64285715738932292,"h":0.015988371407532842,"t":"They aren't essential, by any means. And there's a danger of tailoring what you say","x":0.1334586401907874,"c":1,"y":0.27034883750502292},{"h":0.016105362007254098,"y":0.28622021884549487,"t":"to fit whatever slides you can find. While it can be good to include slides, you could","c":1,"x":0.13345866252612743,"w":0.64285710652669259},{"t":"end up spending too long looking for suitable ones. You might find it better to leave","x":0.13529323947333494,"w":0.64107854207356774,"y":0.30239089653363327,"h":0.017402642170843974,"c":1},{"y":0.3207223643222854,"w":0.075468413035074872,"c":1,"x":0.13331842496782134,"h":0.014078527132465379,"t":"them out."},{"t":"I see. Another thing I was wondering about was how to start. I know presentations","w":0.63157892862955722,"c":1,"y":0.33419188696781543,"x":0.13345865903108595,"h":0.017707662588538287},{"c":1,"h":0.016097875080489432,"x":0.13533835514181733,"y":0.35318737900645547,"t":"often begin with 'First I'm going to talk about this, and then Ill talk about that, but I","w":0.63157892862955722},{"t":"thought about asking the audience what they know about nanotechnology.","y":0.36918604670879929,"w":0.57142857869466146,"h":0.014587295492925145,"x":0.13533834214013316,"c":1},{"y":0.38506117166610321,"c":1,"x":0.13533834404948333,"w":0.63909774780273443,"t":"That would be fine if you had an hour or two for the presentation, but you might find","h":0.014648130457399766},{"y":0.40115904696019544,"h":0.016097875080489321,"w":0.644736836751302,"c":1,"x":0.13533834843112877,"t":"that you can't do anything with the answers you get, and it simply eats into the short"},{"t":"time that's available.","y":0.41715116284528353,"c":1,"x":0.13345865089937362,"w":0.1616541290283203,"h":0.014593846553844325},{"h":0.018177634274199606,"t":"So, maybe I should mention a particular way that nanotechnology is used, to focus","y":0.43250264296867447,"w":0.63543965657552082,"c":1,"x":0.13527423416592796},{"w":0.13909774780273437,"x":0.13533834419073809,"y":0.45058139537325803,"t":"people's attention.","h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1},{"t":"That sounds sensible.","w":0.17152901967366538,"x":0.1351135447967198,"y":0.4649398033304426,"h":0.016263038207850578,"c":1},{"t":"What do you think I should do next? I really have to plan the presentation today and","x":0.13345864919953687,"y":0.4825581392611995,"h":0.015988372635703074,"w":0.64473683675130211,"c":1},{"h":0.012233353398034996,"t":"tomorrow.","w":0.079093189239501954,"y":0.49969727677325815,"c":1,"x":0.13338573610364013},{"c":1,"w":0.048995685577392575,"y":0.51728521029257579,"t":"TUTOR:","x":0.071366818767448409,"h":0.011941207276569665},{"h":0.016097875080489321,"y":0.51448808769850263,"c":1,"x":0.13345865474093993,"t":"Well, initially I think you should ignore all the notes you've made, take a small piece","w":0.64097742716471351},{"h":0.017555685098602725,"c":1,"y":0.53047772089105472,"t":"of paper, and write a single short sentence that ties together the whole presentation:","x":0.13528542213512851,"w":0.64859024047851566},{"c":1,"y":0.5463618803032948,"x":0.13345865349127203,"t":"it can be something as simple as 'Nanotechnology is already improving our lives'.","h":0.016138119154105346,"w":0.62593983968098954},{"t":"Then start planning the content around that. You can always modify that sentence","x":0.13533835072938133,"y":0.56395348856954741,"c":1,"h":0.014604141692230899,"w":0.62593983968098965},{"c":1,"t":"later, if you need to.","x":0.13157894960663352,"y":0.57984546047411067,"w":0.15789473215738931,"h":0.016097875080489432},{"w":0.043347454071044914,"h":0.011883905758338864,"t":"RUSS:","c":1,"y":0.59725572142393979,"x":0.069491686631040286},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395234588844,"t":"OK","y":0.59593023256495059,"x":0.13533834550775897,"w":0.028195489247639982},{"c":1,"t":"TUTOR:","w":0.050796788533528647,"h":0.011745312869433588,"y":0.63802269225785124,"x":0.069526418069323193},{"t":"RUSS:","x":0.069548871890554018,"w":0.043233083089192714,"y":0.67151162779222062,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907148116789,"t":"TUTOR:","c":1,"y":0.68749999988903565,"x":0.069548871922933075,"w":0.05075188000996908},{"x":0.069548872120817173,"c":1,"w":0.043233083089192714,"t":"RUSS:","y":0.73546511607710441,"h":0.011627907148116789},{"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.75290697680238283,"w":0.05075188000996908,"x":0.069548871923586872,"h":0.010174418447559619,"c":1},{"x":0.069548871899525314,"y":0.80087209291114236,"w":0.043233083089192714,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"t":"RUSS:"},{"w":0.049097019831339531,"h":0.010838447811522212,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.81652845046939604,"x":0.07131615153238588,"c":1},{"x":0.069548871618763247,"y":0.91424418590797119,"w":0.04887218157450357,"t":"TUTOR:","h":0.011627907148116901,"c":1},{"t":"Q22","x":0.79887218053640496,"h":0.013081395234588844,"w":0.037593984603881858,"y":0.19040697676497309,"c":1},{"y":0.2834302323834671,"h":0.018895348808647183,"c":1,"t":"Q23","x":0.79887218098032631,"w":0.039473683039347396},{"y":0.43459302327851335,"w":0.03571428616841632,"h":0.013081395234588955,"t":"Q24","c":1,"x":0.79887218013007755},{"y":0.53197674420469598,"c":1,"t":"Q25","h":0.013081395234588844,"w":0.039473683039347396,"x":0.79511278245754868},{"t":"OK, now let's think about actually giving the presentation. You've only given one","h":0.017441859494004897,"w":0.61278193155924487,"x":0.13533836095909929,"y":0.63517441887218362,"c":1},{"y":0.65260785600251381,"x":0.13345865165967236,"w":0.58270675659179672,"c":1,"h":0.016097875080489432,"t":"before, if I remember correctly, about an experiment you'd been involved in."},{"t":"That's right. It was pretty rubbish!","x":0.13333393237864111,"w":0.25962313334147136,"h":0.017199127580454832,"y":0.6685387540756158,"c":1},{"h":0.016099746198095288,"w":0.69924809773763019,"t":"Let's say it was better in some respects than in others. With regard to the structure, L Q26","y":0.68448164860814198,"x":0.13345866001276382,"c":1},{"x":0.13340221782977077,"w":0.6467259216308594,"c":1,"y":0.70016229134763353,"t":"felt that you ended rather abruptly, without rounding it off. Be careful not to do that in","h":0.017550613983016716},{"t":"next week's presentation.","x":0.13345864513023079,"h":0.014592910687998728,"y":0.7179652286334921,"w":0.19924812316894533,"c":1},{"x":0.13153303972501362,"c":1,"h":0.017446237921484475,"t":"And you made very little eye contact with the audience, because you were looking","y":0.74856870897873462,"w":0.63168202718098954},{"w":0.03571428616841632,"t":"Q27","y":0.75145348839288006,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"x":0.79699248088717867},{"h":0.017605932006049874,"c":1,"x":0.13339564172764579,"t":"down at your notes most of the time. You need to be looking at the audience and only","y":0.76503363793313972,"w":0.65614262898763021},{"h":0.014642514648240956,"c":1,"y":0.78332260142440524,"t":"occasionally glancing at your notes.","x":0.13345864308911579,"w":0.27819549560546875},{"c":1,"x":0.13287515776592551,"h":0.013048152346343933,"y":0.79995169538835842,"w":0.053703136444091804,"t":"Mmm."},{"w":0.65413533528645829,"c":1,"x":0.1334586479364458,"h":0.016097875080489432,"y":0.8139085640786663,"t":"Your body language was a little odd. Every time you showed a slide, you turned your"},{"y":0.81540697676283547,"h":0.013081395234588844,"t":"Q28","x":0.78947368394744255,"w":0.043233083089192714,"c":1},{"y":0.83129426938260864,"c":1,"h":0.01463596297323666,"t":"back on the audience so you could look at it - you should have been looking at your","w":0.64849624633789071,"x":0.13345864365222687},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1,"t":"laptop. And you kept scratching your head, so I found myself wondering when you","x":0.13157895108914139,"y":0.84738372112778448,"w":0.63533833821614583},{"y":0.86337209274636428,"h":0.015988372635703185,"x":0.1334586353382439,"t":"were next going to do that, instead of listening to what you were saying!","w":0.55075190226236981,"c":1},{"h":0.016097875080489432,"x":0.13345865474214766,"y":0.87926593686534504,"c":1,"w":0.64097742716471351,"t":"Oh dear. What did you think of the language? I knew that not everyone was familiar"},{"t":"with the subject, so I tried to make it as simple as I could.","x":0.13345865895057726,"y":0.89665164216575211,"w":0.43984959920247391,"h":0.01481004507405026,"c":1},{"y":0.91133720944521601,"w":0.63157892862955722,"h":0.015988371407532731,"x":0.13157896030928137,"t":"Yes, that came across. You used a few words that are specific to the field, but you","c":1},{"y":0.91279069769306809,"w":0.03571428616841632,"t":"Q29","c":1,"x":0.79699248088195718,"h":0.013081395234588844},{"x":0.13345865208957444,"t":"always explained what they meant, so the audience wouldn't have had any difficulty","w":0.64473683675130211,"y":0.9272376046219869,"h":0.016097875080489432,"c":1},{"x":0.13345864350131378,"y":0.94622093027291143,"t":"understanding.","w":0.11842105865478517,"h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1}]}